    'Congressional committees heard testimony from present and former holders of permits issued by state boards that license operators of private Christian family campgrounds and wilderness retreat centers. According to the testimony, the boards had unfairly manipulated their disciplinary proceedings in order to revoke the permits of some operators as a means of protecting favored operators from competition. In response, Congress enacted a statute prescribing detailed procedural requirements for the disciplinary proceedings of all state boards that license operators of such Christian family campgrounds and retreat centers. The statute requires the state boards to provide permit holders with adequate notice and opportunity for an adjudicatory hearing in all disciplinary proceedings. The statute also prescribes membership criteria for the state boards, designed to ensure that the boards are likely to be neutral. Which of the following provides the best source of authority for this federal statute?', 'Congressional committees heard testimony from present and former holders of permits issued by state boards that license operators of private Christian family campgrounds and wilderness retreat centers. According to the testimony, the boards had unfairly manipulated their disciplinary proceedings in order to revoke the permits of some operators as a means of protecting favored operators from competition. In response, Congress enacted a statute prescribing detailed procedural requirements for the disciplinary proceedings of all state boards that license operators of such Christian family campgrounds and retreat centers. The statute requires the state boards to provide permit holders with adequate notice and opportunity for an adjudicatory hearing in all disciplinary proceedings. The statute also prescribes membership criteria for the state boards, designed to ensure that the boards are likely to be neutral. Which of the following provides the best source of authority for this federal statute?', 'Which of the following provides the best source of authority for this federal statute?',
