The signatures appeared in this format:

> ESTHER EVENTS, LLC
> By /s/ Esther Vale, Managing Member
>
> MANNA MEDIA, INC.
> By /s/ Timothy Reed, Vice President
>
> /s/ Lydia Stone, President

Manna Media, Inc., later became insolvent and failed to produce the show. Esther Events sued Lydia individually for breach. At trial, Lydia offered evidence from negotiations before the contract was signed that only Manna Media, Inc., was to be legally responsible for producing the show.', 'A private company that stages ticketed Christian arts events signed a written production-services contract for a Psalm 23 drone-light show. The opening recital stated:

