(B) No promise of payment can be reasonably inferred from Martha''s presence at the scene.

(C) There was no consideration for any promise Martha might have made.

(D) Daniel was an officious intermeddler.

**Correct Answer: (B)**', 'which of the following would be Martha''s most effective argument in defense?',
