    '14562_chapel_bank_stop', 'CRIMINAL', 'Constitutional Protection of Accused Persons', 'Terry stop, frisk, and noncustodial questioning',
    'Several armed robberies had occurred near closing time at city banks. Witnesses described the robber as a masked person wearing a white chapel-retreat hoodie and navy sweatpants. Just before one branch closed, police saw Paul wearing a white chapel-retreat hoodie and navy sweatpants while pacing near the bank entrance and watching the doors.

The officers stopped Paul and frisked the outer layers of his clothing for weapons, but found none. They asked what he was doing near the bank and noted that his clothing matched the description from the recent robberies. After pausing for several moments, Paul confessed. The officers had not given Miranda warnings. After Paul was charged with the robberies, he moved to suppress the confession.

The parties agreed, and the court properly found, that the officers had reasonable suspicion but not probable cause at all times before Paul confessed.', 'Several armed robberies had occurred near closing time at city banks. Witnesses described the robber as a masked person wearing a white chapel-retreat hoodie and navy sweatpants. Just before one branch closed, police saw Paul wearing a white chapel-retreat hoodie and navy sweatpants while pacing near the bank entrance and watching the doors.

The officers stopped Paul and frisked the outer layers of his clothing for weapons, but found none. They asked what he was doing near the bank and noted that his clothing matched the description from the recent robberies. After pausing for several moments, Paul confessed. The officers had not given Miranda warnings. After Paul was charged with the robberies, he moved to suppress the confession.

The parties agreed, and the court properly found, that the officers had reasonable suspicion but not probable cause at all times before Paul confessed.', 'Should Paul''s motion to suppress be granted?',
    NULL, 'draft', 'c3_transformed', 1, '{"source_qid": "14562_chapel_bank_stop", "schema_variant": "transformed_v1", "outline_code": "75080101", "transformed": true, "c3_confidence": "ANCHOR_ASSISTED", "c3_verdict": "PASS"}'
