**Pass-1 Step 2 — Invariant layer preserved:** The answer array remains a 2×2 grid: `{robbery | attempted robbery}` × `{assault | no assault}`. The credited quadrant remains **attempted robbery only**. The dominant trap remains the answer that gets attempted robbery right but adds assault.

