    '16036_farm-homecoming-manslaughter', 'CRIMINAL', 'Homicide', 'Manslaughter',
    'Peter returned home from a day at the livestock auction to find his wife Ruth and their two daughters lying dead inside their farmhouse — each beaten and killed. His young son staggered to the door, bleeding, and said: "It was Stephen from next door — he did this to them." Peter said, "I''ll kill him for what he did," grabbed his hunting rifle, and walked to Stephen''s property. When Peter knocked, Stephen opened the door and said, "Yes, I killed them. Now what are you going to do?" Peter shot and killed Stephen. State statutes codify the common law definitions of voluntary and involuntary manslaughter, and define first-degree murder as "the deliberate and premeditated killing of a human being" and second-degree murder as "the killing of a human being with malice aforethought." If Peter is charged with voluntary manslaughter, the court should find him', 'Peter returned home from a day at the livestock auction to find his wife Ruth and their two daughters lying dead inside their farmhouse — each beaten and killed. His young son staggered to the door, bleeding, and said: "It was Stephen from next door — he did this to them." Peter said, "I''ll kill him for what he did," grabbed his hunting rifle, and walked to Stephen''s property. When Peter knocked, Stephen opened the door and said, "Yes, I killed them. Now what are you going to do?" Peter shot and killed Stephen. State statutes codify the common law definitions of voluntary and involuntary manslaughter, and define first-degree murder as "the deliberate and premeditated killing of a human being" and second-degree murder as "the killing of a human being with malice aforethought." If Peter is charged with voluntary manslaughter, the court should find him', 'the court should find him',
