    '16039_priscilla-heater-valve', 'CRIMINAL', 'Homicide', 'Manslaughter',
    'A state code requires residential water heaters to be equipped with a temperature-pressure relief valve, and provides that any person who knowingly removes such a valve from a residential water heater shall be guilty of a misdemeanor. Priscilla operated a licensed residential plumbing service. Naomi called Priscilla to ask whether anything could be done about her water heater''s relief valve, which dripped regularly and wasted water. Priscilla explained that removing the valve would eliminate the dripping and offered to do so for a fee. Naomi paid the fee and Priscilla removed the valve. Although Priscilla worked carefully, she accidentally disturbed a fitting on the water heater''s gas supply line without realizing she had done so. Priscilla did know, however, that loose gas fittings could leak and cause death. When Naomi returned home later that day, natural gas was slowly leaking from the disturbed fitting into her house. After spending several hours in the house, Naomi was fatally poisoned by gas inhalation.', 'A state code requires residential water heaters to be equipped with a temperature-pressure relief valve, and provides that any person who knowingly removes such a valve from a residential water heater shall be guilty of a misdemeanor. Priscilla operated a licensed residential plumbing service. Naomi called Priscilla to ask whether anything could be done about her water heater''s relief valve, which dripped regularly and wasted water. Priscilla explained that removing the valve would eliminate the dripping and offered to do so for a fee. Naomi paid the fee and Priscilla removed the valve. Although Priscilla worked carefully, she accidentally disturbed a fitting on the water heater''s gas supply line without realizing she had done so. Priscilla did know, however, that loose gas fittings could leak and cause death. When Naomi returned home later that day, natural gas was slowly leaking from the disturbed fitting into her house. After spending several hours in the house, Naomi was fatally poisoned by gas inhalation.', 'If Priscilla is prosecuted for the homicide of Naomi, she should be found',
