       'Priscilla committed a misdemeanor AND but-for causation exists. The unlawful act doctrine is real. But the doctrine requires the underlying crime to be malum in se or inherently dangerous. A regulatory safety-code prohibition is malum prohibitum. Gold Key GK-CRIMINAL-MSMR-MALUM-01: but-for causation alone is not the test; the character of the underlying crime controls.', NULL, 'RC-CRIMINAL-MSMR-MALUM-01'
