**C.** It may negate premeditation and deliberation, reducing the degree of the offense, but it does not automatically eliminate all homicide liability.

**D.** It establishes an insanity defense if Timothy cannot later remember pulling the trigger.', 'What is the most accurate effect of the intoxication evidence?',
