) VALUES (
    '22292_sabotaged-vehicle', 'CRIMINAL', 'Homicide', 'Murder',
    'Daniel overheard two young men, Paul and Timothy, talking about killing a rival named James. The plan was to cut the brake lines on James''s truck so that James would crash on the winding mountain road near their town. Daniel hoped the plan would succeed. He decided to help without telling them about it. Late that night, Daniel snuck into the garage where James''s truck was parked and disabled the truck''s brake-warning light so that James would not notice the brake failure. The next morning, Timothy decided not to go through with the plan and left. However, Paul went to the garage and cut the brake lines. James drove the truck down the mountain road, could not stop, crashed, and died. A statute in the jurisdiction provides that persons Daniel''s age are adults for purposes of criminal liability.', 'Daniel overheard two young men, Paul and Timothy, talking about killing a rival named James. The plan was to cut the brake lines on James''s truck so that James would crash on the winding mountain road near their town. Daniel hoped the plan would succeed. He decided to help without telling them about it. Late that night, Daniel snuck into the garage where James''s truck was parked and disabled the truck''s brake-warning light so that James would not notice the brake failure. The next morning, Timothy decided not to go through with the plan and left. However, Paul went to the garage and cut the brake lines. James drove the truck down the mountain road, could not stop, crashed, and died. A statute in the jurisdiction provides that persons Daniel''s age are adults for purposes of criminal liability.', 'If Daniel is charged with conspiracy, will a court find him guilty?',
