**B.** Despite Paul''s timely request for exclusion of witnesses, the judge allows Paul''s eyewitness Barnabas to remain in the courtroom after Barnabas has already testified, even though Barnabas is expected to be recalled for further cross-examination.

**C.** The judge allows cross-examination about the credibility of a witness even though no question relating to credibility was asked on direct examination.

**D.** The judge allows Daniel''s attorney to ask Timothy, who was called as an adverse witness, questions on cross-examination that go well beyond the scope of direct examination by Paul.', 'Which of the following would be an ERROR?',
