    '22198_antiquarian_smuggler', 'EVIDENCE', 'Hearsay and Circumstances of Its Admissibility', 'Hearsay Exceptions (Requiring Unavailability)',
    'Paul had been a member of a Mediterranean antiquities-smuggling ring for 20 years and had participated in many crimes during that period of time. Because Paul''s testimony was crucial to the prosecutor''s attempt to break the smuggling ring, Paul was offered transactional immunity if he would testify against other members of the ring. He did so, and his testimony resulted in several convictions. Paul subsequently wrote and published a richly illustrated coffee-table book about the antiquities trade in which he described in detail many of the crimes he had committed, including the bludgeoning death of Stephen with a bronze statuette. Following the publication, Stephen''s wife Ruth commenced a civil action against Paul for damages resulting from the wrongful death of her husband. At the trial, a museum curator who had been called to the scene of Stephen''s attack testified that just before Stephen died, he heard him say, "I''m dying. I saw Paul strike me with the statue." The jurisdiction has a "dead man''s statute." If Paul moves to strike the museum curator''s testimony, his motion should be', 'Paul had been a member of a Mediterranean antiquities-smuggling ring for 20 years and had participated in many crimes during that period of time. Because Paul''s testimony was crucial to the prosecutor''s attempt to break the smuggling ring, Paul was offered transactional immunity if he would testify against other members of the ring. He did so, and his testimony resulted in several convictions. Paul subsequently wrote and published a richly illustrated coffee-table book about the antiquities trade in which he described in detail many of the crimes he had committed, including the bludgeoning death of Stephen with a bronze statuette. Following the publication, Stephen''s wife Ruth commenced a civil action against Paul for damages resulting from the wrongful death of her husband. At the trial, a museum curator who had been called to the scene of Stephen''s attack testified that just before Stephen died, he heard him say, "I''m dying. I saw Paul strike me with the statue." The jurisdiction has a "dead man''s statute." If Paul moves to strike the museum curator''s testimony, his motion should be', 'If Paul moves to strike the museum curator''s testimony, his motion should be',
    NULL, 'draft', 'c3_transformed', 1, '{"source_qid": "22198_antiquarian_smuggler", "schema_variant": "transformed_v1", "outline_code": "33040301", "transformed": true, "c3_confidence": "HEURISTIC_STRUCTURAL", "c3_verdict": "PASS"}'
