) VALUES (
    '22215_farm-equipment-deposition', 'EVIDENCE', 'Hearsay and Circumstances of Its Admissibility', 'Requiring unavailability of declarant',
    'Peter and Daniel were injured when a hay baler they were operating on Peter''s farm suddenly jammed and then lurched forward, crushing Daniel''s arm and injuring Peter''s back. They sued AgriMax, the company that serviced the baler, claiming AgriMax had improperly repaired a safety clutch. According to both men, the baler''s rotor seized and then released violently without warning. Before trial, Daniel was diagnosed with aggressive liver cancer. Knowing he would not survive until trial, Daniel agreed to be deposed by AgriMax''s attorneys. Daniel died shortly thereafter. At trial, AgriMax argued that Peter and Daniel had disabled the safety guard before operating the baler. Peter offered into evidence Daniel''s deposition testimony, in which Daniel stated: "The rotor just locked and then snapped free on its own — we never touched the safety guard, and Peter kept yelling that the brake wasn''t responding." Is Daniel''s deposition testimony admissible?', 'Peter and Daniel were injured when a hay baler they were operating on Peter''s farm suddenly jammed and then lurched forward, crushing Daniel''s arm and injuring Peter''s back. They sued AgriMax, the company that serviced the baler, claiming AgriMax had improperly repaired a safety clutch. According to both men, the baler''s rotor seized and then released violently without warning. Before trial, Daniel was diagnosed with aggressive liver cancer. Knowing he would not survive until trial, Daniel agreed to be deposed by AgriMax''s attorneys. Daniel died shortly thereafter. At trial, AgriMax argued that Peter and Daniel had disabled the safety guard before operating the baler. Peter offered into evidence Daniel''s deposition testimony, in which Daniel stated: "The rotor just locked and then snapped free on its own — we never touched the safety guard, and Peter kept yelling that the brake wasn''t responding." Is Daniel''s deposition testimony admissible?', 'Is Daniel''s deposition testimony admissible?',
