    'Eighteen years ago, Martha owned Cedar Lot, a half-acre parcel behind an old hymn-printing shop. She duly delivered a deed of Cedar Lot "to a private Bible-memory academy so long as it is used for tutoring classes." The deed was promptly and properly recorded.

