    'The Jubilee Cottages Association governs a small residential community where each cottage lot is individually owned. After several owners began placing bright blue ceramic birdbaths in their front prayer gardens, the association’s board adopted a new rule stating that, going forward, owners and occupants may place only plain white stone benches in front gardens. The board said the rule would make the cottages look “more reverent and orderly” from the street. After the rule was adopted, Stephen bought several blue ceramic birdbaths to place in his front garden. The recorded community documents are silent about the board’s authority to regulate decorative objects, garden structures, or landscaping placed on individually owned lots.', 'The Jubilee Cottages Association governs a small residential community where each cottage lot is individually owned. After several owners began placing bright blue ceramic birdbaths in their front prayer gardens, the association’s board adopted a new rule stating that, going forward, owners and occupants may place only plain white stone benches in front gardens. The board said the rule would make the cottages look “more reverent and orderly” from the street. After the rule was adopted, Stephen bought several blue ceramic birdbaths to place in his front garden. The recorded community documents are silent about the board’s authority to regulate decorative objects, garden structures, or landscaping placed on individually owned lots.', 'Is the new rule enforceable against Stephen?',
