    'Peter and Ruth are purchasing a modest home in a small town. Their real-estate agent recommended a local bank for their mortgage. The couple went to the bank on their own to finalize the loan. A bank employee there began preparing the mortgage paperwork and charged the couple a document-preparation fee. May the bank employee properly draft the mortgage documents?

