Lydia''s company did not record the option. The next spring, Mary suffered a serious illness and sold the cedar grove to Stephen. When Mary sold the grove, she told Stephen about Lydia''s company''s option.', 'Lydia owned Covenant Candleworks, a private company that made Scripture-themed candles and devotional journals for Christian bookstores. After a planning team projected the company''s land needs for the next 45 years, Lydia''s company began looking for a quiet tract near one of its workshops.

