    'Naomi entered into a four-year written lease with Caleb for a rural building that Naomi planned to use as a traveling ministry supply depot. The lease contained a clause prohibiting subletting without Caleb''s written permission. The lease contained no express reservation of Caleb''s right to terminate the leasehold in the event of a breach. About ten months into the lease, Naomi and her family received a calling to long-term overseas mission work, and maintaining the depot became unworkable. Naomi asked Caleb to release her from the lease, but Caleb refused. The following month, Naomi transferred all of her remaining interest in the lease to a minister named Stephen, who moved into the building and began operating the depot. When Caleb learned of the transfer, he demanded that Stephen vacate the premises. If Caleb brings an appropriate proceeding to remove Stephen on the ground that the transfer to him was void, should the court rule in Caleb''s favor?', 'Naomi entered into a four-year written lease with Caleb for a rural building that Naomi planned to use as a traveling ministry supply depot. The lease contained a clause prohibiting subletting without Caleb''s written permission. The lease contained no express reservation of Caleb''s right to terminate the leasehold in the event of a breach. About ten months into the lease, Naomi and her family received a calling to long-term overseas mission work, and maintaining the depot became unworkable. Naomi asked Caleb to release her from the lease, but Caleb refused. The following month, Naomi transferred all of her remaining interest in the lease to a minister named Stephen, who moved into the building and began operating the depot. When Caleb learned of the transfer, he demanded that Stephen vacate the premises. If Caleb brings an appropriate proceeding to remove Stephen on the ground that the transfer to him was void, should the court rule in Caleb''s favor?', 'Should the court rule in Caleb''s favor?',
    NULL, 'draft', 'c3_transformed', 1, '{"source_qid": "22056_naomi-caleb-subletting", "schema_variant": "transformed_v1", "outline_code": "82010404", "transformed": true, "c3_confidence": "ANCHOR_ASSISTED", "c3_verdict": "PASS"}'
