    'Hannah and Timothy, longtime friends from a Bible study group, owned a private lakeside cabin parcel as joint tenants. After Timothy''s small Scripture-printing business ran short of cash, he signed a mortgage in favor of Covenant Bank, purporting to give the bank a lien on the entire cabin parcel. Hannah did not know about the mortgage.

