) VALUES (
    '18794_bethany_banner_tube', 'TORTS', 'Negligence', 'Contributory negligence',
    'Lydia runs a private Scripture-lettering supply shop. Before a weekend workshop, she asked Mary to drive a sealed cardboard banner tube to Bethany Hall, a privately rented classroom where several friends were meeting to make verse posters. Inside the tube was a small bottle of caustic etching solution, but Lydia wrapped the tube in kraft paper and did not tell Mary what was inside because she thought Mary would refuse to carry it.

Mary placed the tube in the side storage pocket of her van and started toward Bethany Hall. On the way, she saw Peter, an old Bible-study friend, walking along the road toward the same workshop, and offered him a ride. While Peter was sitting in the front passenger seat, liquid began to seep from the storage pocket and dampen Peter''s canvas tote. Without saying anything to Mary, Peter reached into the pocket and lifted the wet tube away from the tote. As soon as the liquid touched Peter''s hand, it burned his skin severely.', 'Lydia runs a private Scripture-lettering supply shop. Before a weekend workshop, she asked Mary to drive a sealed cardboard banner tube to Bethany Hall, a privately rented classroom where several friends were meeting to make verse posters. Inside the tube was a small bottle of caustic etching solution, but Lydia wrapped the tube in kraft paper and did not tell Mary what was inside because she thought Mary would refuse to carry it.

